{
  "uid": "crm-realtime",
  "title": "Threadwise realtime: the loop behind the sockets",
  "description": "The API process read for the realtime question: loop delay and utilization, open handles, heap and GC. Socket-level counters do not exist yet (EL-B18).",
  "tags": [
    "threadwise",
    "event-loop",
    "realtime"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "utc",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "label": "Instance",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "crm-prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(crm_runtime_last_report_timestamp_seconds{service=\"api\"}, instance)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(crm_runtime_last_report_timestamp_seconds{service=\"api\"}, instance)",
          "refId": "v",
          "qryType": 1
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What this dashboard covers",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Sockets are served by the **API process** (`realtime.gateway.ts`, socket.io with the Redis adapter), so the realtime path shares the API loop. Everything here is that process, read for the realtime question: is the loop that fans messages out healthy, and how many handles does it hold.\n\n**Not measured today (no series exists):** connected sockets, rooms, events emitted per second, fan-out latency, Redis adapter lag. Those need new counters in the gateway; they are tracked as EL-B18 and are not drawn here with substitute numbers."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "The loop that fans messages out",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Event loop delay",
      "description": "A delay here is a pause in every connected client’s updates.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "crm-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "crm-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(crm_event_loop_delay_p95_seconds{service=\"api\",instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "crm-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(crm_event_loop_delay_p99_seconds{service=\"api\",instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "crm-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(crm_event_loop_delay_max_seconds{service=\"api\",instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "max in window",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.05
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.25
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Event loop utilization",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "crm-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "crm-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(crm_event_loop_utilization_ratio{service=\"api\",instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "worst instance",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.85
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Open handles (sockets, timers, requests)",
      "description": "process.getActiveResourcesInfo().length: every open socket counts, but so do timers and pending requests. A trend, not a connection count.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "crm-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "crm-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(crm_process_active_resources{service=\"api\",instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "worst instance",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "crm-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(crm_process_active_resources{service=\"api\",instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "all instances",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
